乐氏问》七十二事","evidence":["rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"问学者","evidence":["rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2"]},{"person":"rensu-p0045","role":"受问之《左氏》学者","evidence":["rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2","source_order":[16,312,20],"order":3440},{"id":"rensu-e-o181","title":"黄初中乐详征拜博士；太学初立博士十余人略不亲教，惟详五业并授、以杖画地牵譬引类至忘寝食，独擅名远近","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-543de1368c4068f2e432","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"黄初中乐详征拜博士；太学初立博士十余人略不亲教，惟详五业并授、以杖画地牵譬引类至忘寝食，独擅名远近","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"五业并授之博士","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235","source_order":[16,312,126],"order":3441},{"id":"rensu-e-o182","title":"乐详学既精悉又善推步三五，别受诏与太史典定律历","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-cb2c8959576f52617cf8","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"乐详学既精悉又善推步三五，别受诏与太史典定律历","evidence":["rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"受诏定历者","evidence":["rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9","source_order":[16,312,217],"order":3442},{"id":"rensu-e-o184","title":"正始中乐详以年老罢归于舍，本国宗族归之，门徒数千人","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-7a01b0ef06f378d73165","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"正始中乐详以年老罢归于舍，本国宗族归之，门徒数千人","evidence":["rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"罢归而授徒者","evidence":["rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c","source_order":[16,312,270],"order":3443},{"id":"rensu-e-o222","title":"弘农郡无知经者，令狐邵历问诸吏，有欲远行就师辄假遣，令诣河东就乐详学经，粗明乃还，因设文学，弘农学业转兴","accounts":[{"id":"rensu-a-fa13989467156d92b632","label":"裴注·魏略","text":"弘农郡无知经者，令狐邵历问诸吏，有欲远行就师辄假遣，令诣河东就乐详学经，粗明乃还，因设文学，弘农学业转兴","evidence":["rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336"]}],"participants":[{"person":"rensu-p0004","role":"遣吏就学者","evidence":["rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336"]},{"person":"rensu-p0001","role":"就学之经师","evidence":["rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336"]},"ordering_evidence":"rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336","source_order":[16,376,160],"order":3469}],"persons":[{"id":"rensu-p0001","name":"乐详","evidence":["rensu-q-e9727e4f717de7fe68c5","rensu-q-ca15fd4cdd135f906884","rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2","rensu-q-d65c6bd2d3a9abd3a03d","rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235","rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9","rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c","rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336","rensu-q2-069fdb98f8c95dd1207b"],"facts":[{"id":"rensu-f2-7bcf6a7105313f015677","text":"《魏略》记太和中为骑都尉。","evidence":["rensu-q2-069fdb98f8c95dd1207b"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"rensu-q-3628f3598831a43396c2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"建安初，详闻公车司马令南郡谢该，善《左氏传》，乃从南阳（步诣）〔步涉诣许，从〕该问疑难诸要。今《左氏乐氏问》七十二事，详所撰也","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":20,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-564d4c7432d048940d5c","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"至正始中，以年老，罢归于舍，本国宗族归之，门徒数千人","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":270,"end":296,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-607ef625f369d7428336","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-bac77b5b1dcca1cb164c","layer":"pei","quote":"是时，郡无知经者。乃历问诸吏，有欲远行就师，辄假遣，令诣河东，就乐详学经；粗明乃还，因设文学。由是弘农学业转兴","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":375,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5a7a9e505ad84ef4841b","start":160,"end":215,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-700b254744e85c62a7e9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"详，学既精悉，又善推步三五，别受诏与太史典定律历","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":217,"end":241,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-75f5518383d741765100","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-00f950c34e91f362cff0","layer":"original","quote":"诏封恕子预，为丰乐亭侯，邑百户","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":30,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-9b5afc66f4ba6d3ac235","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"至黄初中，征拜博士。于时太学初立，有博士十余人。学多褊狭，又不熟悉；略不亲教，备员而已。惟详，五业并授；其或难教，质而不解，详无愠色；以杖画地，牵譬引类，至忘寝食。以是独擅名于远近","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":126,"end":216,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-ca15fd4cdd135f906884","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-2868236895451c5e83ad","layer":"pei","quote":"博士乐详，由畿而升。至今河东特多儒者，则畿之由矣","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":128,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ce39c7d31a3d066f00c2","start":10,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-d65c6bd2d3a9abd3a03d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"所问既了而归乡里。时杜畿为太守，亦甚好学，署详文学祭酒，使教后进。于是河东学业大兴","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":84,"end":125,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e9727e4f717de7fe68c5","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-00f950c34e91f362cff0","layer":"original","quote":"甘露二年，河东乐详年九十余，上书讼畿之遗绩〖6〗。朝廷感焉","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":299,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q2-069fdb98f8c95dd1207b","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-7bf59cb2b376dfc3aa4d","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《魏略》曰：“乐详字文载。少好学，建安初，详闻公车司马令南郡谢该，善《左氏传》，乃从南阳（步诣）〔步涉诣许，从〕该问疑难诸要。今《左氏乐氏问》七十二事，详所撰也。所问既了而归乡里。时杜畿为太守，亦甚好学，署详文学祭酒，使教后进。于是河东学业大兴。至黄初中，征拜博士。于时太学初立，有博士十余人。学多褊狭，又不熟悉；略不亲教，备员而已。惟详，五业并授；其或难教，质而不解，详无愠色；以杖画地，牵譬引类，至忘寝食。以是独擅名于远近。详，学既精悉，又善推步三五，别受诏与太史典定律历。太和中，转拜骑都尉。详学优能少，故历三世，竟不出为宰守。至正始中，以年老，罢归于舍，本国宗族归之，门徒数千人。”","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":311,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-d8fdacafc497b3097224","start":0,"end":298,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
